  "lore": {
    "summary": "A house on the northern shelf of The Upper Wards, close enough to the rail line that the trains are a fact of daily life rather than a nuisance anyone still notices. Streets here are as often stairs as road, stacked along the slope above the coast.",
    "playerFacing": "Thin-walled and close to the tracks -- the whole house shifts very slightly when a train goes past, timed precisely enough that a person could set a clock by it, and several of the neighbours do exactly that.",
